{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "b45a2f9f44ad2375965ccab4f355a7ee95f01c6ac1bd8139d632a190732b841d", "ja": "高みを目指して！", "zh": "追求更高的境界！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2dd5966899679744bb4c650ed0617e1c01b438a08b5886e43d8e40119643c4a9", "ja": "朋花が歩を呼び出した。自分の未熟さを叱ら\nれるのではないかと思っていた歩は、それが\nダンス特訓の申し出だと知って驚く。朋花の\n言葉で自信を取り戻した歩は、特訓の申し出\nを受けるのだった。", "zh": "朋花把步找过去。\n步本以为对方要斥责自己的不成熟，\n没想到朋花是想请步为她进行舞蹈特训，\n让步感到惊讶。在朋花的鼓励下，\n步找回自信，并接受了替她特训的请求。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1abe72242de8bfaee22e06964dc02b966b14f2d8c534bd7ed523e00efb66873e", "ja": "（今朝、歩が何かを気にしているようだったけど、\n結局聞きだすタイミングがなかった……）", "zh": "（今天早上，步好像有什么心事，\n但一直找不到机会问她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1001_031tom", "source_sha256": "90239b3c044a6630000ed14381504dc6dd72a309f929ce20cedf96a75d435084", "ja": "ふう……。\n今日は、こんなところでしょうか～。", "zh": "呼……\n今天就差不多到这边吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a732ac044f9a3b997300c44a37f0a39ca464815e731eaf8df18eaef96549d58d", "ja": "お疲れさま。みんな、見違えたよ。\nすごく迫力のあるダンスになってたぞ！", "zh": "辛苦了。各位，我刮目相看啰。\n你们的舞蹈变得很有气势喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "6a7e3c52c69ba0f790a76b62858d92d6314bb81e3ee8e30652935217914af203", "ja": "ありがとうございます、\n{$P$}！", "zh": "谢谢你的夸奖，\n{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "0714e8922fd7d55822a3ca277cc598e6d38a3ae276759f1827f29da87d15f6c0", "ja": "やっぱり、今みたいなダンスの方が、\n今のアタシたちにも合ってるのかな……。", "zh": "果然，像刚刚那样的舞蹈，\n也比较适合现在的我们吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0af8c60ead1db4bda8d526f9b3f1fe79cf52e6313d3a0a746ce6d68ffed7aef0", "ja": "月のイメージと一口に言っても、ひとつじゃない。\nいろいろ試して、レベルアップしていこう！", "zh": "月亮的印象说来简单，但不会只有一种答案。\n多方尝试，不断改进吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "5a6767205d95d9236d809b3d4c9d0ba7f5404adc306421fccad047b716ea7a34", "ja": "今回の私達は、\n夜の闇を彷徨う子豚ちゃん達を導く月……。", "zh": "我们这次是月亮，\n要引导徘徊于暗夜的小猪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1007_031tom", "source_sha256": "18d367f057b6c993ee54a1be2c99166283dcc8da3508e4f14575678279b54829", "ja": "激しいだけでも、穏やかなだけでもなく。力強さと\n優雅さを兼ね備えていなくてはいけませんからね～。", "zh": "不能过于激烈或沉着，\n而是要力与美兼具呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "74f373b7a9f72be43e446e7caccd72cc05ac8263420606d1f90ff18661b0126f", "ja": "おお……さすが朋花、\nしっかりしてるっていうか……。", "zh": "喔喔……不愧是朋花，\n感觉好成熟……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "1e90d301fe79a5015cf0aa1b8b84721bfbfaeaa0bc25e8f5065789248435665a", "ja": "そうだね！　いろいろ試して、\nもっともっと表現の幅を広げていこう！", "zh": "没错！我们多多尝试，\n继续拓展表现的幅度吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1010_031tom", "source_sha256": "9e90e542a891c1da78aea352b1bf022db49479cf9367d4bfe089765f105170ec", "ja": "あ、そうそう、歩さん？\nちょっとこの後、残ってもらっていいですか～？", "zh": "啊，对了，步姊。\n你待会可以留下来吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1011_034ayu", "source_sha256": "fa78bb0c740ed462981dd4296edac2604536738ce98eff8ec59b6d563c7b5ec6", "ja": "へっ！？　あ、アタシ！？\n時間はあるけど……どうしたの？", "zh": "咦！？我、我吗！？\n我是有空啦……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1012_031tom", "source_sha256": "b7dee0f70013fe6a3dfb64fcfd5f9bf17220b4f63a6da0b2d1f0074ac66d08db", "ja": "うふふっ。それは秘密、ですよ～。", "zh": "呵呵，这是秘密喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "227c3dd317b7352f2c6f45b143c584048088414a6759d5948d73dce6647c1bd9", "ja": "ん？　朋花、仕事の話なら、\n俺も残った方がいいよな？", "zh": "嗯？朋花，如果是工作上的事情，\n我留下来比较好吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1014_031tom", "source_sha256": "18385e9dd471412470a997b2629741f2b432741fd707666e76a8caf5270b44b8", "ja": "何を言っているんですか？\n{$P$}さんが残るのは当然です～。", "zh": "你在说什么呢？\n{$P$}先生，你当然要留下来啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1015_031tom", "source_sha256": "42a663ea577a6cb4dbb9106015b0ea520b1bad70349307e04eed338eee8dc0d9", "ja": "担当アイドルを置いて帰ろうとするなら、\n罰を与えますからね～？", "zh": "要是你敢丢下担当偶像跑回去，\n可是要受处罚喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1016_p", "source_sha256": "2e11382c66ed1d543265172db21ea9c649eabf35c4b4e8f5f68b0e51911e28fc", "ja": "……そ、そんなこと、するわけないだろ？\nじゃあ俺も残るから……紗代子、お疲れさま。", "zh": "……我、我怎么可能做那种事情呢？\n那我也留下来吧……纱代子，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1017_031tom", "source_sha256": "437ae5d8b9668422fb6c5e720b0975e1564cd9cc9c061156a7a2f269f57ee48a", "ja": "では、準備をして来ますから、\n少し待っていてください～。", "zh": "那么，我这就去准备，\n请稍等一下～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1065_p", "source_sha256": "9585d9dfb8cb7ed794331aa9aca1c22d7f5ec57b7abc158a52a83a8e8b50a7f6", "ja": "（というわけで、朋花と歩の居残りミーティングに\n俺も付き合うことになった）", "zh": "（于是，我就这样留下来\n陪朋花和步一起开会了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e64014b7a2588458ee55668f447c9dff9acd5beba51a8ab5666ad6050eb42726", "ja": "……{$P$}、どうしよう！？\nアタシ、朋花に怒られるかも……。", "zh": "……{$P$}，怎么办！？\n我好像惹朋花生气了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f01db7001e5280fafb091a76c1e3356aa3b57c20a15357be4ad4ca8afa6d4a1b", "ja": "えっ？　どうしたんだ、突然？", "zh": "咦？怎么突然这么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1020_034ayu", "source_sha256": "03dea0bdcf341d88b1e56251563f65824671cf5a7b3e2c2f288a0958292973f1", "ja": "ほら、今朝も言ったけど、なんかアタシだけ、\nみんなの役に立ててない気がしない？", "zh": "就是啊，我早上不是也说过，\n感觉好像只有我没帮到大家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1021_034ayu", "source_sha256": "e84ef298f22ef665d4159920b3cd46207de2c5eacfa0738a0e8e1a4ccbf1daaa", "ja": "だってアタシ、物静かでも落ち着いてもいないし、\nミステリアスでもないし……。", "zh": "因为我既不端庄也不沉着，\n更别提什么神秘感……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1022_034ayu", "source_sha256": "888e12f755cb17cc0ce70774441ed9f37ec0a085520fa077ad971c5808931389", "ja": "月の公演なのに、全然月らしいことできてないんだよ！\nでも、朋花はその辺カンペキだから……。", "zh": "我们明明是月亮公演，我却一点都不像月亮！\n可是，朋花在这方面可以说是完美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1023_p", "source_sha256": "4265fc081dc6a78c750e7c7d65f15fdb78de39ff6da43acf7820439b476e7119", "ja": "いや、歩、それは……。", "zh": "不对，步，你这是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "bb2769d57b196fcdcb8ff1b799798fde637af04b58f34dd4b0beac617462e07f", "ja": "……お待たせしました～。\n実はですね、歩さん。", "zh": "……久等了～\n是这样的，步姊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1025_034ayu", "source_sha256": "50bc41eeab85e64cdd8b86bebbdcd924bc759191585a3f05910f0053b00611fc", "ja": "ひぇっ。は、はいっ！", "zh": "呜哇！请、请说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1026_031tom", "source_sha256": "13a7481edd9fbb8473417150f577daede2fb3543678be3a60e280da8f91a577b", "ja": "歩さんに、ダンスの特訓をしてもらいたいんです。\nお願いできませんか～？", "zh": "我想请步姊替我做舞蹈的特训。\n可以麻烦你吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1027_034ayu", "source_sha256": "25cf3e76d1279559452fcdd002c9dfe4257ec505f7ab20385a187649604d02ad", "ja": "うんゴメン、できません！\n……え？　い、今なんて？", "zh": "嗯对不起，我办不到！\n……咦？你、你刚刚说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1028_031tom", "source_sha256": "09f28131c42b6ef4e7d2a596e9f3410d6aef0e9bec430dec811eb6d77500c1c1", "ja": "？　ダンスを教えてください、と言ったのですが……？", "zh": "嗯？我刚刚说想请你教我舞蹈啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1029_034ayu", "source_sha256": "864d02582ed01ca97595b9a0c44e959030665f510fb4e111f2b4fc55cae32dd5", "ja": "ダンス！？　って、なんで？\n朋花なら、もうバッチリできてるじゃん。", "zh": "舞蹈！？可是，为什么？\n朋花，你已经跳得很完美了不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1030_031tom", "source_sha256": "838c6282c857592baf1c1176ca5191a1f1df5ec74950e37a05b3312dd6996e3e", "ja": "ふふっ、あの程度で満足してはいられません。\n紗代子さんも言っていましたよね？", "zh": "呵呵，怎么可以那么轻易就满足呢？\n纱代子不是也说过吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1031_031tom", "source_sha256": "f92641386be5c9b39e1b887be8152e503e2c4ca65d126feb113550f20d23104c", "ja": "私を崇拝する子豚ちゃん達のためにも、\n聖母として、月として。高みを目指さなくては～♪", "zh": "这也是为了崇拜我的那些小猪们，\n我作为圣母、作为月亮，必须追求更高的境界才行～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1032_034ayu", "source_sha256": "15e69ca0ea3b811934ac7081ca614beb01f17dc0aedfd2959abdaa69ecc530bd", "ja": "……そういうことか。\nなんか、アタシ……ますます肩身が狭いなあ。", "zh": "……原来是这样啊。\n感觉我好像……更加无地自容了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1033_031tom", "source_sha256": "cb3ee3be61576ada9757e7590b720d1f4ea45c231e7c7cb9abae93e6d8bd6271", "ja": "あら……。どうしてですか？", "zh": "哎呀……为什么这么说呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1034_034ayu", "source_sha256": "60ebae6b0fce869879cb74d7094e2db504c9ff9c0bc24fb845fa4e36d15d675b", "ja": "うん……さっき{$P$}にも言って\nたんだ。アタシだけ、全然月らしくなれてないって。", "zh": "嗯……我刚刚才向{$P$}说过。\n成员里面只有我一点都不像月亮。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1035_031tom", "source_sha256": "86523215410787b306ce5811c93a5a6ce4ab81588e5957943a4b579e143ac45a", "ja": "月らしく……ですか？　でも、歩さんはもう、\n立派に月を体現してるじゃありませんか～。", "zh": "不像月亮……是吗？可是，\n我觉得步姊已经完美体现月亮的印象了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1036_034ayu", "source_sha256": "edeacc39bf0832ec10a0739bdc19e3432375f2cf619dd9d8fb90594cf08743a8", "ja": "へ……？\nど、どういうこと？", "zh": "咦……？\n什、什么意思啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1037_031tom", "source_sha256": "8be9fa91af0f320d969ecd0ceb3a5b00a7775bc1fc689f28736c17ff22389271", "ja": "歩さんは、本場のダンスを学ぶために\nアメリカまで行かれたんですよね～？", "zh": "步姊为了学习道地的舞蹈，\n甚至还去了美国不是吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1038_034ayu", "source_sha256": "88f01af9243d1e03bfb1f9897c605cda16af78fde2cd9968068de07c986a1d39", "ja": "えっ。……う、うん、そうだけど？", "zh": "呃……嗯、嗯，是啊，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1039_031tom", "source_sha256": "cdc1d2af8ff9f595472234b1969f9da947f676f7742da03bb6f66f1ff0905ea7", "ja": "本場の子豚ちゃん達にも喜んでもらうために、\nたくさん努力をしたんですよね～？", "zh": "你也为了给当地的小猪们带来欢乐，\n而做了许多努力不是吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1040_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b4f813d40d9e070cc8791d2796a263a88f7a2037fb676c11b53ba0983c42832e", "ja": "いや……っ。そんなに\n大したもんじゃないんだよ！", "zh": "不……唔，\n那不是什么大不了的事啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1041_034ayu", "source_sha256": "df4adc93eeb2632c896b4bffe86a150e0b7d6b68a51f48eedd0c479edccbe4d8", "ja": "アタシはただ……みんなと一緒に最高に盛り上がれる\nくらい、踊れるようになりたかった……それだけだよ。", "zh": "我只是……想把舞跳得更好，\n才能和大家一起带来最热烈的演出……只是如此罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1042_031tom", "source_sha256": "9b24dd4d7ddfdf967db93548f505f9b9773b41c2bbba2a28d9aa76b7aba9f660", "ja": "そうですよね。そういう姿勢を、\n私も聖母として見習いたいと思います～。", "zh": "我没说错吧？你这样的心态，\n我身为圣母，也觉得值得效法喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1043_034ayu", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1044_p", "source_sha256": "092b4da8d9447d2a1bf699138fbed08ee6c2f9f76eb150d1c69775390cf307d0", "ja": "……そうだな。最高に盛り上がりたいっていう歩の\n気持ちは、つまり、みんなに輝いてほしいって事だし。", "zh": "……是啊。步，你希望带来最热烈的演出，\n这也就是希望大家发光发热啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1045_p", "source_sha256": "96a0a80abc8981ab9574334d84ff2afbec32eb74ff8b0a82e2e54668ed6373fd", "ja": "それで歩も最高に輝けるっていうなら……。\n歩はこれ以上ないくらい、月らしいってことだ！", "zh": "而步如果也为此绽放耀眼光芒……\n这样的步不就是最像月亮的吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1046_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5fb14b99739435a6ee2edda96811d085117fc8ef4bf29832a42c3f9e333a1ffd", "ja": "ええっ！？　そ、そうなのかな？　そんなホメられる\nと……く、くすぐったいっていうか、恥ずかしいよ～！", "zh": "咦咦！？是、是这样吗？你们这样夸我……\n让、让我觉得好害羞，怪难为情的耶～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1047_p", "source_sha256": "fd4d7b0fa9f55ec0569ea13795455958443d7b9317f984f39f032437b0c19a59", "ja": "恥ずかしがることないだろ？\nもっと自信を持っていいと思うぞ！", "zh": "不用难为情啊。\n我觉得你要更有自信！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1048_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f2cf546ff30ae8f14ae78c4781d4debfec50bdf8de9be90c087c5f74fd1e7baf", "ja": "う、うん……わかった。\nサンキュー、朋花！　{$P$}！", "zh": "嗯、嗯……我知道了。\n谢啦，朋花！{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1049_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8df22e3ce6e4aa10a608dc1a229f40691eeceb78d2aefcd9dd3fea179a8cefa4", "ja": "おかげで、自信……とまではいかないけど……\nうん、スッキリした！", "zh": "幸亏有你们，让我有了……说有自信是夸张了点……\n嗯，不过我确实豁然开朗了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1050_034ayu", "source_sha256": "7b21187b6ef2b3637633f44b2c7d45cb4ba63677d404f41df1cd00805a278be8", "ja": "よしっ、んじゃバリバリっといきますか！\nさあ朋花、ダンスの特訓、スタートだ！", "zh": "好！那就鼓足全力上吧！\n来吧，朋花，开始舞蹈特训吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1051_031tom", "source_sha256": "5d14307c1e4c9862d4a6118dc19573112eb66b4263dadba108fa21344a756448", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとうございます。\nでは、よろしくお願いしますね～♪", "zh": "呵呵！谢谢你。\n那么，就麻烦你啰～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1052_p", "source_sha256": "122b6337e1d7788bf1414bacdb7c861245739a59942cd713491f8878a002ef6f", "ja": "（ふたりの特訓は夜まで続いた。さすがの朋花も、\n歩にみっちりしごかれてヘトヘトみたいだ）", "zh": "（两人一直特训到晚上。就算是朋花，\n在步的严格训练下似乎也吃不消了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1053_p", "source_sha256": "0f939f2bc6d3c59afe00af4049d40bd6b7c02e872216163b48952516e6eb6f8b", "ja": "大丈夫か、朋花？　歩は先に帰したし、朋花が帰るのは\nもうしばらく休んでからでもよかったんだけど。", "zh": "朋花，你还好吧？步已经先回去了，\n你休息一下后再回去也没关系的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1054_031tom", "source_sha256": "91a61704549627a2b753cb52f4d1e895605bf0f2dcb01f0806c757a4ad55cad4", "ja": "ふふ。私の心配だなんて、十年早いですよ～♪\n聖母として、月として……このくらいは当然です～。", "zh": "呵呵，想要担心我，还早得很喔～♪\n作为圣母、作为月亮……这点辛苦是理所当然的喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1055_p", "source_sha256": "880a6ab3370a47f409efd11afb6859c2d2355432afdeb3c2a7cec69e88a38cde", "ja": "そうか。でも、無理だけはするなよ。\n月だって、たまには雲間に隠れるんだからな。", "zh": "这样吗？不过，千万不能勉强喔。\n月亮有时也是会躲到云朵后面的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1057_031tom", "source_sha256": "df5da73078c12a4d571aaacf7f55b8e183e8986dfb7ac67bd722caae970d6c9b", "ja": "ふふ、なんですか～？　そんなことを言って\n自分が休みたいだけじゃありませんよね～？", "zh": "呵呵，怎么啦～？说得这么好听，\n该不会只是你自己想休息而已吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1058_p", "source_sha256": "75053538f772e2965f49627a35437753d7da5467eecb469bab58b89ff26f730a", "ja": "いや、そんなつもりは……\nあ、でも、ちょっと休みたいかな？", "zh": "不是，我没那个意思……\n啊，只是我好像真的想休息一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1059_031tom", "source_sha256": "68fd21736f69a52f9b2f337f5e77a08a1a7e38dd7ea854b720596dd71eabcb95", "ja": "……すぐバレるウソをつく人は、お仕置きですよ？", "zh": "……说谎不打草稿的人，就得接受惩罚喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1060_p", "source_sha256": "f8f0f9437f23cfd1e516e2aabe310519599cbcd6e44c6fa72aa644e8c30ffd1d", "ja": "はは、ごめんごめん。\n大丈夫ならいいんだ。", "zh": "哈哈，抱歉抱歉。\n你还撑得住就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1061_031tom", "source_sha256": "1a99f32579a4e4b60e90b4c2bc5981ec409664edc54222c24361244a9c1be9a3", "ja": "……ふふっ。安心してください。\n今後、私に休息が必要な時は……。", "zh": "……呵呵，请放心。\n以后，如果我需要休息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1062_031tom", "source_sha256": "e89eeadc9cb0067b0818b62716d7b43c22862cea1a69d45bd7f6b4157679c699", "ja": "あなたに、私の雲となってもらうことにします。\n責任重大ですよ、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "就要请你来当我的云朵了。\n这是重责大任喔，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1063_p", "source_sha256": "c78a8ced0bb73c95631f6677627f543dd7577186f035edd3217b87b9b43fbc2f", "ja": "もちろん、構わないよ。\nいつでも呼んでくれ！", "zh": "当然可以，我没问题。\n随时都能找我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0052_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0052_story_05_1064_p", "source_sha256": "2d7cea1c447a78364dc2232f795ea5cc73c5f47d0b24055161e911bfa1989fd6", "ja": "（朋花の顔に、普段とは少し違う表情が浮かんでいた\n気がするのは……月のせいかもしれないな）", "zh": "（我好像看到朋花脸上浮现跟平时不太一样的表情……\n可能是月亮惹的祸吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
